<title>USA: USDA to hold briefing at 1645 ET on EU meat row.</title>
<headline>USDA to hold briefing at 1645 ET on EU meat row.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Wednesday said it would hold a news conference at 1645 EDT/2045 GMT on the long-running trade dispute with the European Union over meat import rules.</p>
</text>
